{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The proverbs of Solomon the son of David, king of Israel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To know wisdom and instruction;\nTo discern the words of understanding;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To receive instruction in wise dealing,\nIn righteousness and justice and equity;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To give prudence to the simple,\nTo the young man knowledge and discretion:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That the wise man may hear, and increase in learning;\nAnd that the man of understanding may attain unto sound counsels:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To understand a proverb, and a figure,\nThe words of the wise, and their dark sayings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah is the beginning of knowledge;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the foolish despise wisdom and instruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, hear the instruction of thy father,\nAnd forsake not the law of thy mother:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they shall be a chaplet of grace unto thy head,\nAnd chains about thy neck.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, if sinners entice thee,\nConsent thou not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If they say, Come with us,\nLet us lay wait for blood;\nLet us lurk privily for the innocent without cause;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let us swallow them up alive as Sheol,And whole, as those that go down into the pit;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We shall find all precious substance;\nWe shall fill our houses with spoil;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt cast thy lot among us;\nWe will all have one purse:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, walk not thou in the way with them;\nRefrain thy foot from their path:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For their feet run to evil,\nAnd they make haste to shed blood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For in vain is the net spread\nIn the sight of any bird:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these lay wait for their own blood;\nThey lurk privily for their own lives.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So are the ways of every one that is greedy of gain;\nIt taketh away the life of the owners thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom crieth aloud in the street;\nShe uttereth her voice in the broad places;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She crieth in the chief place of concourse;\nAt the entrance of the gates,\nIn the city, she uttereth her words:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long, ye simple ones, will ye love simplicity?\nAnd scoffers delight them in scoffing,\nAnd fools hate knowledge?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn you at my reproof:\nBehold, I will pour out my spirit upon you;\nI will make known my words unto you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because I have called, and ye have refused;\nI have stretched out my hand, and no man hath regarded;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye have set at nought all my counsel,\nAnd would none of my reproof:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I also will laugh in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the day of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your calamity;\nI will mock when your fear cometh;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When your fear cometh as a storm,\nAnd your calamity cometh on as a whirlwind;\nWhen distress and anguish come upon you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then will they call upon me, but I will not answer;\nThey will seek me diligently, but they shall not find me:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For that they hated knowledge,\nAnd did not choose the fear of Jehovah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They would none of my counsel,\nThey despised all my reproof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall they eat of the fruit of their own way,\nAnd be filled with their own devices.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the backsliding of the simple shall slay them,\nAnd the careless ease of fools shall destroy them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.1.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.1.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But whoso hearkeneth unto me shall dwell securely,\nAnd shall be quiet without fear of evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
